# Built-in demo song for #123: "Twinkle, Twinkle, Little Star".
#
# A wordless 'ah' melody is deliberate: the note contour is easy to hear without
# consonants masking the attacks. Two portamento entries make the glide audible;
# the remaining entries use a deliberately short legato knee. Vibrato is gated
# until after each onset, so the note attacks remain clean.

schema 1
name Twinkle, Twinkle, Little Star
a4 440
scale chromatic
note C4 0.42 ah transition=legato glide=0.006s vibrato=5.5:10c:0.18s:0.22s
note C4 0.42 ah transition=legato glide=0.006s
note G4 0.42 ah transition=portamento glide=0.180s vibrato=5.5:12c:0.20s:0.25s
note G4 0.42 ah transition=legato glide=0.006s
note A4 0.42 ah transition=portamento glide=0.160s vibrato=5.5:12c:0.20s:0.25s
note A4 0.42 ah transition=legato glide=0.006s
note G4 0.68 ah transition=portamento glide=0.200s overshoot=18c vibrato=5.5:14c:0.24s:0.30s
note F4 0.42 ah transition=portamento glide=0.170s
note F4 0.42 ah transition=legato glide=0.006s
note E4 0.42 ah transition=portamento glide=0.170s vibrato=5.5:10c:0.18s:0.22s
note E4 0.42 ah transition=legato glide=0.006s
